---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import SiteNav from '../../components/SiteNav.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../../components/SiteFooter.astro';
---

<Layout title="Enterprise Valuator — Maxq Analytics">
  <SiteNav />

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="pt-32 pb-20 px-6 bg-ink text-cream">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <a href="/#add-ons" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-xs text-white/40 hover:text-white/70 transition-colors mb-8">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="19" y1="12" x2="5" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 19 5 12 12 5"/></svg>
        All add-ons
      </a>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-6">
        <span class="font-mono text-[10px] font-medium text-brand-300 bg-brand-600/10 border border-brand-600/20 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider">Add-on</span>
        <span class="font-mono text-[10px] font-medium text-violet-400 bg-violet-400/10 border border-violet-400/20 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider">Report</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="font-black mb-6 leading-none" style="font-size: clamp(40px, 6vw, 72px); letter-spacing: -0.04em">Enterprise Valuator</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-cream/55 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed mb-10">A periodic business valuation report built directly on the metrics inside your Semantic Nexus. No manual input, no spreadsheet gymnastics — your live operational data drives a defensible valuation at any point in time.</p>
      <a href="https://calendly.com/philip-boontje?utm_content=enterprise-valuator" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-cream text-ink font-semibold px-8 py-3.5 rounded-full hover:bg-white transition-colors text-sm">
        Explore the proof of concept
        <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- How it works -->
  <section class="py-24 px-6 bg-cream">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <div class="md:flex items-start gap-16">
        <div class="shrink-0 mb-8 md:mb-0">
          <div class="text-xs font-mono font-medium text-brand-600 uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">How it works</div>
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-ink" style="letter-spacing: -0.02em; max-width: 280px">Your metrics. A valuation you can actually defend.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-ink/60 leading-relaxed max-w-xl pt-1">
          <p>Most business valuations are one-off exercises: a financial model built manually in a spreadsheet, using whatever numbers the finance team could pull together at that moment. They take weeks, go stale the day they're finished, and are almost impossible to reproduce consistently.</p>
          <p>The Enterprise Valuator takes a different approach. Because your key financial and operational metrics already live inside the Semantic Nexus — defined, maintained, and always current — we can apply recognised valuation methodologies directly to that live data.</p>
          <p>The result is a valuation report that refreshes automatically as your metrics move. You can see how revenue growth, gross margin, and retention translate into enterprise value, run scenarios by adjusting assumptions, and produce a consistent, defensible number whenever a board meeting, fundraise, or acquisition discussion requires it.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Mockup -->
  <section class="py-24 px-6 bg-warm">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <div class="mb-10">
        <div class="text-xs font-mono font-medium text-brand-600 uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">Example output</div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-ink mb-2" style="letter-spacing: -0.02em">Valuation driven by your live metrics.</h2>
        <p class="text-ink/50 text-sm">Adjust the metric inputs to see how operational changes affect your enterprise value trajectory.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl">
        <div style="background:#0F1C38; padding:24px 28px 22px; border-radius:16px; min-width:780px;">

          <!-- Header -->
          <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:flex-start; margin-bottom:16px;">
            <div>
              <p style="font-size:15px; font-weight:700; color:#fff; letter-spacing:-0.2px;">Enterprise Valuator</p>
              <p style="font-size:11px; color:#6B87A8; margin-top:3px;">Northfield Logistics B.V. · Updated Q2 2026</p>
            </div>
            <div style="display:flex; gap:8px; align-items:center;">
              <div style="font-size:9px; color:#A78BFA; background:rgba(167,139,250,0.12); border:1px solid rgba(167,139,250,0.25); padding:3px 10px; border-radius:20px; font-family:monospace; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.05em;">Revenue Multiple</div>
              <div style="font-size:9px; color:#8DA5C4; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); padding:3px 10px; border-radius:20px; font-family:monospace; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.05em;">ARR-based</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Top KPI cards -->
          <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.6fr 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap:12px; margin-bottom:14px;">

            <div style="background:#1E3A6E; border-radius:10px; padding:16px 18px; border:1px solid #2E5090;">
              <p style="font-size:9px; color:#7A9CC0; font-family:monospace; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.06em; margin-bottom:6px;">Estimated Enterprise Value</p>
              <p style="font-size:28px; font-weight:900; color:#fff; letter-spacing:-0.04em; line-height:1;">€4.2M</p>
              <p style="font-size:10px; color:#02C39A; margin-top:4px;">↑ +12% vs Q1 2026</p>
              <p style="font-size:9px; color:#4B6A8A; margin-top:3px; font-family:monospace;">Revenue multiple: 3.2×</p>
            </div>

            <div style="background:#162040; border-radius:10px; padding:16px 18px; border:1px solid #1E3060;">
              <p style="font-size:9px; color:#7A9CC0; font-family:monospace; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.06em; margin-bottom:6px;">Revenue Growth (YoY)</p>
              <p style="font-size:22px; font-weight:900; color:#4FC3F7; letter-spacing:-0.03em; line-height:1;">18%</p>
              <p style="font-size:9px; color:#02C39A; margin-top:4px;">↑ +3pp year-over-year</p>
              <p style="font-size:9px; color:#4B6A8A; margin-top:3px; font-family:monospace;">ARR: €1.31M</p>
            </div>

            <div style="background:#162040; border-radius:10px; padding:16px 18px; border:1px solid #1E3060;">
              <p style="font-size:9px; color:#7A9CC0; font-family:monospace; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.06em; margin-bottom:6px;">Gross Profit Margin</p>
              <p style="font-size:22px; font-weight:900; color:#02C39A; letter-spacing:-0.03em; line-height:1;">67%</p>
              <p style="font-size:9px; color:#8DA5C4; margin-top:4px;">→ Stable vs prior quarter</p>
              <p style="font-size:9px; color:#4B6A8A; margin-top:3px; font-family:monospace;">GP: €288K / quarter</p>
            </div>

            <div style="background:#162040; border-radius:10px; padding:16px 18px; border:1px solid #1E3060;">
              <p style="font-size:9px; color:#7A9CC0; font-family:monospace; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.06em; margin-bottom:6px;">Ann. Revenue per Account</p>
              <p style="font-size:22px; font-weight:900; color:#A78BFA; letter-spacing:-0.03em; line-height:1;">€4,800</p>
              <p style="font-size:9px; color:#02C39A; margin-top:4px;">↑ +€240 vs prior year</p>
              <p style="font-size:9px; color:#4B6A8A; margin-top:3px; font-family:monospace;">273 active accounts</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Chart + Scenario row -->
          <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:2.2fr 1fr; gap:12px;">

            <!-- Chart -->
            <div style="background:#132040; border-radius:10px; padding:16px 18px; border:1px solid #1E3060;">
              <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-bottom:10px;">
                <p style="font-size:11px; font-weight:600; color:#D0DFF0;">Revenue & Valuation Trajectory</p>
                <div style="display:flex; gap:14px; align-items:center;">
                  <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:4px;">
                    <div style="width:10px; height:10px; background:#3B82F6; border-radius:2px; opacity:0.7;"></div>
                    <span style="font-size:8px; color:#8DA5C4; font-family:monospace;">Revenue</span>
                  </div>
                  <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:4px;">
                    <div style="width:10px; height:10px; background:#02C39A; border-radius:2px; opacity:0.7;"></div>
                    <span style="font-size:8px; color:#8DA5C4; font-family:monospace;">Gross Profit</span>
                  </div>
                  <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:4px;">
                    <div style="width:18px; height:2px; background:#F59E0B;"></div>
                    <span style="font-size:8px; color:#8DA5C4; font-family:monospace;">Enterprise Value</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <svg viewBox="0 0 420 185" style="width:100%;display:block;" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <!-- Grid lines -->
                <line x1="36" y1="15"  x2="390" y2="15"  stroke="#1E3060" stroke-width="0.6"/>
                <line x1="36" y1="50"  x2="390" y2="50"  stroke="#1E3060" stroke-width="0.6"/>
                <line x1="36" y1="85"  x2="390" y2="85"  stroke="#1E3060" stroke-width="0.6"/>
                <line x1="36" y1="120" x2="390" y2="120" stroke="#1E3060" stroke-width="0.6"/>
                <line x1="36" y1="155" x2="390" y2="155" stroke="#1E3060" stroke-width="0.6"/>
                <!-- Left Y labels (revenue) -->
                <text x="32" y="158" fill="#4B6A8A" font-size="7" font-family="monospace" text-anchor="end">€0</text>
                <text x="32" y="123" fill="#4B6A8A" font-size="7" font-family="monospace" text-anchor="end">100K</text>
                <text x="32" y="88"  fill="#4B6A8A" font-size="7" font-family="monospace" text-anchor="end">200K</text>
                <text x="32" y="53"  fill="#4B6A8A" font-size="7" font-family="monospace" text-anchor="end">300K</text>
                <text x="32" y="18"  fill="#4B6A8A" font-size="7" font-family="monospace" text-anchor="end">400K</text>
                <!-- Right Y labels (valuation) -->
                <text x="394" y="18"  fill="#F59E0B" font-size="7" font-family="monospace">€5M</text>
                <text x="394" y="53"  fill="#F59E0B" font-size="7" font-family="monospace">€4M</text>
                <text x="394" y="88"  fill="#F59E0B" font-size="7" font-family="monospace">€3M</text>
                <text x="394" y="123" fill="#F59E0B" font-size="7" font-family="monospace">€2M</text>
                <text x="394" y="158" fill="#F59E0B" font-size="7" font-family="monospace">€1M</text>

                <!-- Bar groups: centers at 68, 128, 188, 248, 308, 368 -->
                <!-- Revenue bars (width 22, left side of center) -->
                <!-- Heights: 280K=98, 310K=109, 340K=119, 365K=128, 390K=137, 430K=151 (scale: 400K=140px) -->
                <rect x="43"  y="57"  width="22" height="98"  fill="#3B82F6" opacity="0.55" rx="2"/>
                <rect x="103" y="46"  width="22" height="109" fill="#3B82F6" opacity="0.55" rx="2"/>
                <rect x="163" y="36"  width="22" height="119" fill="#3B82F6" opacity="0.55" rx="2"/>
                <rect x="223" y="27"  width="22" height="128" fill="#3B82F6" opacity="0.65" rx="2"/>
                <rect x="283" y="18"  width="22" height="137" fill="#3B82F6" opacity="0.75" rx="2"/>
                <rect x="343" y="4"   width="22" height="151" fill="#3B82F6" opacity="0.85" rx="2"/>
                <!-- GP bars (width 22, right side of center) -->
                <!-- Heights: 188K=66, 208K=73, 228K=80, 245K=86, 262K=92, 288K=101 -->
                <rect x="69"  y="89"  width="22" height="66"  fill="#02C39A" opacity="0.55" rx="2"/>
                <rect x="129" y="82"  width="22" height="73"  fill="#02C39A" opacity="0.55" rx="2"/>
                <rect x="189" y="75"  width="22" height="80"  fill="#02C39A" opacity="0.55" rx="2"/>
                <rect x="249" y="69"  width="22" height="86"  fill="#02C39A" opacity="0.65" rx="2"/>
                <rect x="309" y="63"  width="22" height="92"  fill="#02C39A" opacity="0.75" rx="2"/>
                <rect x="369" y="54"  width="22" height="101" fill="#02C39A" opacity="0.85" rx="2"/>

                <!-- Valuation line (right axis: 5M=y15, 1M=y155 → 4M=140px → 1M=35px) -->
                <!-- 3.2M: 155-(3.2-1)*35=155-77=78 | 3.5M:67 | 3.8M:57 | 4.0M:50 | 4.1M:46 | 4.2M:43 -->
                <polygon points="68,78 128,67 188,57 248,50 308,46 368,43 368,155 68,155" fill="rgba(245,158,11,0.07)"/>
                <polyline points="68,78 128,67 188,57 248,50 308,46 368,43" fill="none" stroke="#F59E0B" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                <circle cx="68"  cy="78" r="3"   fill="#F59E0B" stroke="#132040" stroke-width="1.5"/>
                <circle cx="128" cy="67" r="3"   fill="#F59E0B" stroke="#132040" stroke-width="1.5"/>
                <circle cx="188" cy="57" r="3"   fill="#F59E0B" stroke="#132040" stroke-width="1.5"/>
                <circle cx="248" cy="50" r="3"   fill="#F59E0B" stroke="#132040" stroke-width="1.5"/>
                <circle cx="308" cy="46" r="3"   fill="#F59E0B" stroke="#132040" stroke-width="1.5"/>
                <circle cx="368" cy="43" r="3.5" fill="#F59E0B" stroke="#132040" stroke-width="1.5"/>
                <!-- Label at last valuation point -->
                <rect x="339" y="30" width="46" height="13" rx="3" fill="rgba(10,22,46,0.95)" stroke="#F59E0B" stroke-width="1.2"/>
                <text x="362" y="40" fill="#F59E0B" font-size="7.5" font-weight="bold" font-family="sans-serif" text-anchor="middle">€4.2M</text>
                <!-- X labels -->
                <text x="68"  y="172" fill="#4B6A8A" font-size="7" font-family="monospace" text-anchor="middle">Q1 '25</text>
                <text x="128" y="172" fill="#4B6A8A" font-size="7" font-family="monospace" text-anchor="middle">Q2 '25</text>
                <text x="188" y="172" fill="#4B6A8A" font-size="7" font-family="monospace" text-anchor="middle">Q3 '25</text>
                <text x="248" y="172" fill="#4B6A8A" font-size="7" font-family="monospace" text-anchor="middle">Q4 '25</text>
                <text x="308" y="172" fill="#4B6A8A" font-size="7" font-family="monospace" text-anchor="middle">Q1 '26</text>
                <text x="368" y="172" fill="#4B6A8A" font-size="7" font-family="monospace" text-anchor="middle">Q2 '26</text>
              </svg>
            </div>

            <!-- Scenario adjusters -->
            <div style="background:#132040; border-radius:10px; padding:16px 18px; border:1px solid #1E3060; display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:space-between;">
              <div>
                <p style="font-size:11px; font-weight:600; color:#D0DFF0; margin-bottom:16px;">Scenario Adjustments</p>

                <!-- Revenue Growth -->
                <div style="margin-bottom:14px;">
                  <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; margin-bottom:5px;">
                    <span style="font-size:8px; color:#8DA5C4; font-family:monospace; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.04em;">Revenue Growth</span>
                    <span style="font-size:9px; color:#4FC3F7; font-family:monospace; font-weight:700;">18%</span>
                  </div>
                  <div style="background:#1E3060; border-radius:4px; height:5px; position:relative;">
                    <div style="background:linear-gradient(90deg,#3B82F6,#60A5FA); width:45%; height:100%; border-radius:4px;"></div>
                    <div style="position:absolute; top:50%; left:45%; transform:translate(-50%,-50%); width:9px; height:9px; background:#4FC3F7; border-radius:50%; border:2px solid #132040;"></div>
                  </div>
                  <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; margin-top:3px;">
                    <span style="font-size:7px; color:#2E4070; font-family:monospace;">0%</span>
                    <span style="font-size:7px; color:#2E4070; font-family:monospace;">40%</span>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Gross Profit Margin -->
                <div style="margin-bottom:14px;">
                  <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; margin-bottom:5px;">
                    <span style="font-size:8px; color:#8DA5C4; font-family:monospace; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.04em;">Gross Profit Margin</span>
                    <span style="font-size:9px; color:#02C39A; font-family:monospace; font-weight:700;">67%</span>
                  </div>
                  <div style="background:#1E3060; border-radius:4px; height:5px; position:relative;">
                    <div style="background:linear-gradient(90deg,#02C39A,#34D399); width:67%; height:100%; border-radius:4px;"></div>
                    <div style="position:absolute; top:50%; left:67%; transform:translate(-50%,-50%); width:9px; height:9px; background:#02C39A; border-radius:50%; border:2px solid #132040;"></div>
                  </div>
                  <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; margin-top:3px;">
                    <span style="font-size:7px; color:#2E4070; font-family:monospace;">0%</span>
                    <span style="font-size:7px; color:#2E4070; font-family:monospace;">100%</span>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <!-- ARPA -->
                <div style="margin-bottom:16px;">
                  <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; margin-bottom:5px;">
                    <span style="font-size:8px; color:#8DA5C4; font-family:monospace; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.04em;">Ann. Rev. per Account</span>
                    <span style="font-size:9px; color:#A78BFA; font-family:monospace; font-weight:700;">€4,800</span>
                  </div>
                  <div style="background:#1E3060; border-radius:4px; height:5px; position:relative;">
                    <div style="background:linear-gradient(90deg,#8B5CF6,#A78BFA); width:48%; height:100%; border-radius:4px;"></div>
                    <div style="position:absolute; top:50%; left:48%; transform:translate(-50%,-50%); width:9px; height:9px; background:#A78BFA; border-radius:50%; border:2px solid #132040;"></div>
                  </div>
                  <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; margin-top:3px;">
                    <span style="font-size:7px; color:#2E4070; font-family:monospace;">€0</span>
                    <span style="font-size:7px; color:#2E4070; font-family:monospace;">€10K</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- Scenario result -->
              <div style="background:#1A3060; border-radius:8px; padding:12px 14px; border:1px solid #2E5090;">
                <p style="font-size:8px; color:#7A9CC0; font-family:monospace; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.05em; margin-bottom:6px;">Scenario Valuation</p>
                <p style="font-size:20px; font-weight:900; color:#F59E0B; letter-spacing:-0.03em; line-height:1;">€5.8M</p>
                <p style="font-size:9px; color:#02C39A; margin-top:4px;">↑ +38% vs current</p>
                <p style="font-size:8px; color:#4B6A8A; margin-top:4px; font-family:monospace;">Based on adjusted inputs above</p>
              </div>
            </div>

          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-ink/40 mt-4 text-center font-mono">Illustrative output — valuation methodology and metrics are configured per company context.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What you get -->
  <section class="py-24 px-6 bg-cream">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <div class="mb-14">
        <div class="text-xs font-mono font-medium text-brand-600 uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">What you get</div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-ink" style="letter-spacing: -0.02em">A valuation that moves<br>with your business.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="bg-warm border border-ink/8 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-brand-100 text-brand-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-ink mb-2">Live metric input</h3>
          <p class="text-ink/55 text-sm leading-relaxed">Connected directly to your Semantic Nexus, the valuator reads your latest metrics automatically. No manual data preparation required — the numbers are always current.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-warm border border-ink/8 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-brand-100 text-brand-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="18" y1="20" x2="18" y2="10"/><line x1="12" y1="20" x2="12" y2="4"/><line x1="6" y1="20" x2="6" y2="14"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-ink mb-2">Valuation trajectory</h3>
          <p class="text-ink/55 text-sm leading-relaxed">See how your enterprise value has moved over time — not just a point-in-time number. Track the trend alongside revenue and profitability to understand what's driving the valuation.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-warm border border-ink/8 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-brand-100 text-brand-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 20h9"/><path d="M16.5 3.5a2.121 2.121 0 0 1 3 3L7 19l-4 1 1-4L16.5 3.5z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-ink mb-2">Scenario modelling</h3>
          <p class="text-ink/55 text-sm leading-relaxed">Adjust revenue growth, gross margin, and retention assumptions to model scenarios. See instantly how operational decisions translate into valuation impact before a board meeting or fundraise.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-warm border border-ink/8 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-brand-100 text-brand-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-ink mb-2">Periodic reports</h3>
          <p class="text-ink/55 text-sm leading-relaxed">The valuator runs on a schedule — quarterly, monthly, or whenever you need it. Each report is consistent, reproducible, and versioned so you can compare valuations over time.</p>
        </div>
